1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,460
I was too tired to explain, so I chose silence.

2
00:00:04,760 --> 00:00:10,560
You kept asking what was wrong, I kept saying nothing, you heard my words.

3
00:00:11,780 --> 00:00:17,840
You never heard my silence, you wanted an explanation, I wanted to be understood.

4
00:00:18,980 --> 00:00:23,080
By the time you finally understand me, it might already be too late.
